# Placeholder for the deprecated `TMT-OS/core/` layout.
#
# The TMT-OS runtime was reorganized: the canonical modules now live at
# the top level of `TMT-OS/` (e.g. `TMT-OS/node1_base_os.py`,
# `TMT-OS/node13_metatron.py`). Older CI workflows referenced
# `TMT-OS/core/comprehensive_tests.py` and friends, which no longer exist;
# those workflows have been removed in favor of `ci.yml`.
#
# This directory is kept as an explicit marker so anyone migrating from
# the old layout notices the rename. Do not put code here.

# Test path (legacy): TMT-OS/core/tests/  ->  tests/
# Test runner:        python -m pytest tests/